francis goes places
5 star

An absolute gem in Timog!
​Cafe Roo has such a cozy and aesthetic vibe—perfect for catching up with friends or just relaxing. The location is super convenient and easy to find, as you can see from the illuminated menu leading up the stairs.

​What we loved most was that the drinks aren’t overly sweet. The real flavors actually burst through, which is exactly how we prefer our beverages. The toppings on the drinks add a perfect crunch, too
.
​But the real star of the show was the matcha tiramisu. It’s incredibly amazing—soft, creamy, and has just the right amount of matcha punch without being bitter.

​Highly recommend this place if you're looking for great quality treats and a beautiful space!


diane
4 star

Tried this café late at night thinking it would be quiet—but wow, it was the complete opposite. The place was still super busy and packed even past midnight 😅

Every table was full, people were still coming in, and there was a constant buzz all around. It definitely says a lot about how popular the café is. If you’re looking for a chill and peaceful spot, this might not be it—but if you enjoy a lively vibe, you’ll probably love it here.

Tip: come earlier if you want a seat, or be ready to wait!

